  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖主机冷却水系统可靠性要求，包含冷却能力、冗余配置、温度控制和故障报警保护。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="4">
    <Requirement id="ER-P001-01" level="1" requirementType="reliability">
      <sysml:Name>冷却系统整体可靠性</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应具备较高运行可靠性，在冷却能力不足、冷却水循环中断或温度失控等工况下，应能通过冗余配置、自动切换和报警保护等措施，确保推进装置安全运行。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P001" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M3-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>系统可靠性不足可能导致主机停机，影响航行安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查系统设计图纸和计算书，确认满足船级社规则和IACS UR要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间验证系统在模拟故障工况下的运行可靠性。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却系统整体可靠性】，来自原始需求「较高运行可靠性」。E-CCS-COOL-001、E-DNV-COOL-002、E-IACS-M3-001、E-SOLAS-COOL-001、E-CTRL-COOL-001 共同支撑了系统可靠性设计原则。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
