    <Requirement id="ER-P001-03" level="1" requirementType="control">
      <sysml:Name>冷却水温度控制</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应配置自动温度控制阀，在主机全负荷范围内自动调节冷却水温度，并具备手动备用调节功能。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P001" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>温度失控可能导致主机过热或冷冲击，影响安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查系统图确认配置自动温控阀和手动旁路。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间验证温控阀在负荷变化时的调节性能，温度设定值按主机厂家Technical Data确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却水温度控制】，来自原始需求「温度失控」。E-CTRL-COOL-001 直接支撑自动调节和手动备用要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
