    <Requirement id="ER-P001-04" level="1" requirementType="alarm_protection">
      <sysml:Name>冷却系统故障报警与保护</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应设置冷却水温度持续监控，并配置高温报警、自动减速和停机三级保护；冷却水泵出口应设置低压报警，并在压力过低时自动切换至备用泵。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P001" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M3-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-LDR-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>缺少报警和保护可能导致温度失控或循环中断时无法及时响应，危及主机安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查报警和保护逻辑图，确认符合IACS UR E10/M3.1要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟高温和低压工况，验证报警和保护动作正确，具体动作值按主机厂家Technical Data确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却系统故障报警与保护】，来自原始需求「不能因冷却能力不足、冷却水循环中断或温度失控影响推进装置安全运行」。E-IACS-M3-002 支撑温度监控与报警；E-SUPP-LDR-001 支撑三级保护逻辑；E-DNV-COOL-002 支撑低压报警与自动切换。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
